{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54720","headline":"兵要望江南 占月第十二（京本列第七○二十三首） 二 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占月第十二（京本列第七○二十三首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"占圆月，下小彼军多。\n若总（京本作「见」）大时占我衆（京本作「胜」），全（京本作「总」）无大小亦相和，青白定（京本作「早」）回戈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54720.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54720","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}